{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather the Swarm is a roguelite, run and gun shooter, with Spelunky-like elements. Create your own path flying around, destroying obstacles and fighting aliens as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will impersonate a mercenary tasked to complete missions to extract resources and defeat alien colonies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/032d957308dc45a00a05d45b4a05cb1f.poster.avif?t=1773759683\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/032d957308dc45a00a05d45b4a05cb1f.webm?t=1773759683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/032d957308dc45a00a05d45b4a05cb1f.mp4?t=1773759683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run will be unique: the levels are procedurally generated, weapons will be found only during the run and have different rarities. Killing aliens will let you level up and chose a perk between 3 offered at random every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/e0d3a22e4f3c91c4cdd2a9b2fa4c867d.poster.avif?t=1773759683\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/e0d3a22e4f3c91c4cdd2a9b2fa4c867d.webm?t=1773759683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/e0d3a22e4f3c91c4cdd2a9b2fa4c867d.mp4?t=1773759683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This power ups will form your build and will be able to be levelled up as well. If you find the same power up again, it will improve and get better better. Will you try a balance build with many improvements, or will you try to find your own strategy and min/max your character?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lastly, between runs you will be able to improve your gear and unlock new ways to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/bd53df481d69fd2053b616ccad3f5526.poster.avif?t=1773759683\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/bd53df481d69fd2053b616ccad3f5526.webm?t=1773759683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/extras/bd53df481d69fd2053b616ccad3f5526.mp4?t=1773759683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Wishlist now! You can be one of the first to land on Weather the Swarm</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918920?t=1773759683","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918920?t=1773759683","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/63db9005428e3d00638ef4e49926851cd5dd9cfe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773759683","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918920/63db9005428e3d00638ef4e49926851cd5dd9cfe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773759683","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"descripti